    "alt": "The nurses' station at night: Yusuf, the night nurse, is sitting at the desk with the receiver to his ear, taking notes on a clipboard, next to an open blue folder, the lit lamp, the landline phone, the computer and the printer; on the wall, the magnetic board, the schedule and the clock; the medicine cabinet, the small gray safe, the refrigerator and the red crash cart with its defibrillator.",
